<refentry id="SPI-SPIGETVALUE-1">
<refmeta>
<refentrytitle>SPI_getvalue</refentrytitle>
<refmiscinfo>SPI - 元组信息</refmiscinfo>
</refmeta>
<refnamediv>
<refname>SPI_getvalue
</refname>
<refpurpose>
返回指定属性的字符串值
</refpurpose>
<indexterm id="IX-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-1"><primary>SPI</primary><secondary>解码元组</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm id="IX-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-2"><primary>SPI_getvalue</primary></indexterm>
</refnamediv>
<refsynopsisdiv>
<refsynopsisdivinfo>
<date>1997-12-24</date>
</refsynopsisdivinfo>
<synopsis>
SPI_getvalue(<replaceable class="parameter">tuple</replaceable>, <replaceable class="parameter">tupdesc</replaceable>, <replaceable class="parameter">fnumber</replaceable>)
</synopsis>

<refsect2 id="R2-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-1">
<refsect2info>
<date>1997-12-24</date>
</refsect2info>
<title>输入
</title>
<variablelist>
<varlistentry>
<term>
HeapTuple <replaceable class="parameter">tuple</replaceable>
</term>
<listitem>
<para>
要检查的输入元组
</para>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
<varlistentry>
<term>
TupleDesc <replaceable class="parameter">tupdesc</replaceable>
</term>
<listitem>
<para>
输入元组描述
</para>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
<varlistentry>
<term>
int <replaceable class="parameter">fnumber</replaceable>
</term>
<listitem>
<para>
属性编号
</para>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
</variablelist>
</refsect2>

<refsect2 id="R2-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-2">
<refsect2info>
<date>1997-12-24</date>
</refsect2info>
<title>输出
</title>
<variablelist>
<varlistentry>
<term>
char *
</term>
<listitem>
<para>
属性值，以下情况返回 NULL：
<simplelist>
<member>
属性为 NULL
</member>
<member>
fnumber 超出范围（SPI_result 被设置为
<returnvalue>SPI_ERROR_NOATTRIBUTE</returnvalue>）
</member>
<member>
没有可用的输出函数（SPI_result 被设置为
<returnvalue>SPI_ERROR_NOOUTFUNC</returnvalue>）
</member>
</simplelist>
</listitem>
</varlistentry>
</variablelist>
</refsect2>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsect1 id="R1-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-1">
<refsect1info>
<date>1997-12-24</date>
</refsect1info>
<title>描述
</title>
<para>
<function>SPI_getvalue</function>
   返回指定属性值的外部（字符串）表示形式。
</para>
</refsect1>
<refsect1 id="R1-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-2">
<title>用法
</title>
<para>
属性编号从 1 开始。
</para>
</refsect1>
<refsect1 id="R1-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-3">
<title>算法
</title>
<para>
根据该值的需要分配内存。
</para>
</refsect1>
<!--
<refsect1 id="R1-SPI-SPIGETVALUE-4">
<title>Structures
</title>
<para>None
</para>
</refsect1>
-->
</refentry>

